Surface Forecasting Results
Metric	Value
Surface MSE	2.64 × 10⁻⁴
Surface RMSE	1.62 × 10⁻²
Interpretation

Significant improvement over classical ESN baseline.

~28% RMSE reduction compared to ESN.

Rich nonlinear mixing from bosonic interference.

Limitation

Permanent computation scales factorially.

Dense 2002×2002 matrix evolution.

Computationally expensive.

